{"seq":2,"slug":"the-last-supper","title":"最后的晚餐","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/major-works/the-last-supper","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-masterpiece-of-composition","title":"构图的杰作","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/major-works/the-last-supper/a-masterpiece-of-composition","wordCount":1414,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"fame-and-fragility","title":"盛名与脆弱","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/major-works/the-last-supper/fame-and-fragility","wordCount":1268,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"最后的晚餐\">最后的晚餐</h1><p>《最后的晚餐》（约 1495–1498，约 460 × 880 厘米，米兰恩宠圣母修道院餐厅）是达·芬奇米兰岁月的巅峰之作，公认为西方构图艺术的范本。本章一篇讲它的成就，一篇讲它的脆弱。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"a-masterpiece-of-composition\">构图的杰作</a>：单点透视灭点收敛于耶稣、四三分组、明暗定位与姿态—心理对应——几何中心、叙事中心、神学中心三位一体。</li>\n<li><a href=\"fame-and-fragility\">盛名与脆弱</a>：为何用 secco 而非湿壁画导致先天脆弱、五百年损毁时间线、1978–1999 巴尔奇隆 21 年大修复，以及&quot;修复即诠释&quot;的两难。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两篇分工：第一篇是&quot;它好在哪&quot;（构图智慧），第二篇是&quot;它为何危在旦夕&quot;（媒材、损毁、修复）。延伸阅读：<a href=\"../../life-and-times/the-milan-years/\">生平 · 米兰岁月</a>、<a href=\"../../controversies-and-appraisal/unfinished/\">争议与评价 · 未竟之作</a>。</p>\n"}